<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56767" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κερᾱτο-ειδής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>like horn</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χιτών</span>
			<i>external coat of the eye</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cels.
				7.7.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.70
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
			</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				7.1
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> applied
			to a part of the coat, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευκός</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Onom.</u>
				27
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				10.3
			</span></i> (distinguishing <i>cornea</i> from <i>sclera</i>).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>hornshaped</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λοβοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					2.158
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γωνίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					5.5.6
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μορφή</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				779
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>sounding like a horn</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦχοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Comp.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
